== Documented changes ==
=== Item changes ===
* {{i|Revelation}}: Removed the 2 {{e|Soul Heart}}s on pickup.
* {{i|Plan C}}: Increased the delay before killing Isaac, allowing {{e|Delirium}} and {{e|Mother}} death animations to complete in time.
* {{i|Mega Blast}}: Now receives 6 charges instead of 3 when picking up a {{e|Lil' Battery}}, {{i|9 Volt}}, {{i|Battery Pack}}, and [[48 Hour Energy]].
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Added interactions for {{i|Gello}}, {{i|The Book of Belial}}, {{i|Red Candle}}, {{i|The Candle}}, {{i|Doctor's Remote}}, {{i|Telekinesis}}, and {{i|Mega Blast}}.
* {{i|Odd Mushroom (Thin)}}: Can now break the soft tears cap.
* {{i|Seraphim}}: Now contributes to the {{tf|Seraphim}} transformation.
* {{i|2Spooky}}: In addition to its existing effects, now adds +0.5 [[tears]] and +0.2 [[shot speed]].
* {{i|Black Powder}}: Now grants larger explosions and fireplaces will explode when extinguished.
* {{i|Blood Rights}}: In addition to its existing effects, each use now grants a tears upgrade for the current room.
* {{i|Pageant Boy}}: Now always drops a {{e|Penny}} trinket as part of its rewards.

=== Trinket changes ===
* {{t|Super Ball}}: Bouncing tear chance now scales with luck.
* {{t|Bob's Bladder}}: Now contributes to the Bob transformation.
* {{t|Missing Poster}}: Now has a 33% chance to reveal the Super Secret Room when entering a new chapter.
* {{t|Used Diaper}}: Skatole chance raised to 33%. Spawn a blue fly when entering a new combat room.
* {{t|Rosary Bead}}: In addition to its increased chance of The Bible appearing, when a Devil Deal is earned, holding this trinket will force the deal to be an Angel Deal.
* {{t|Modeling Clay}} / {{t|Error}}: Now correctly display the mimicked item/trinket in Extra HUD when gulped.
* {{t|Louse}}: Now spawns a blue spider when completing a combat room.
* {{t|Karma}}: In addition to its existing effects, holding it will reduce the chance of the Donation Machine jamming. Donating to a Beggar now has a chance to refund the penny, heal Isaac for one heart or increase Isaac's luck. Blood Donation Machines and Confessionals have a chance to heal Isaac for one heart, spawn a beggar, or increase Isaac's luck.  Restock Machines have a chance to increase Isaac's luck.
* {{t|Equality!}}: When keys bombs and coins are all equal in number, gives +2 tear rate.
* {{t|Lazy Worm}}: Now adds +0.5 damage in addition to its shot speed down.
* {{t|Mom's Toenail}}: Dropping/swapping the trinket will now make Mom stomp on its dropped location.
* {{t|Child Leash}}: While held, familiars gain a small damage multiplier.
* {{t|Purple Heart}}: Increased the chance of champion enemies spawning. Chance for champion specific loot drops raised to 50%. Champion loot rewards are doubled.
* {{t|Poker Chip}}: Retains its original effect of 50/50 chance for chests to have double rewards or a hostile fly. If the reward was an item and quality 0-2, the item rolls into another of higher quality. Can pull items from outside of the golden chest pool occasionally. Slightly increased the odds of a payout from slot machines, fortune tellers, crane games, shell games, and restock machines.
* {{t|Cursed Penny}}: Increased chance to teleport Isaac to different rooms based on the coin collected.
* Added effects for all golden trinkets that did not previously have them.

=== Other changes ===
* Added Item Descriptions to the game after defeating Mom one time per save file. Items will need to have been collected one time before their description will appear.
* Several Devil Deal items now have a sacrifice spike cost instead of permanent HP loss. There is a 50% chance to award the item on the first play and 100% chance on the second.
* Added a buffer to item chests with {{i|Glitched Crown}}, {{c|Tainted Isaac}}, and {{p|Soul of Isaac}} to prevent accidentally picking up the rotating item.
* Fixed an issue where double {{r|Angel Room}}s could have two of the same angel. Key pieces that are not yet collected will be prioritized when determining which angel to spawn.
* Travelling to a new floor via {{r|I AM ERROR}} rooms or {{i|Genesis}} will now keep the player on the Alt Path if they were on that route. On {{s|Downpour}}/{{s|Mines}} 2, traveling this way will bring the player back to the standard path if they haven't collected the knife pieces on those respective floors.
* Added time and score display to {{e|The Beast}} fight in Daily runs.
* The beam from {{i|Brimstone}}+{{i|Gello}} will continue for its entire duration even after an enemy is killed.
* Removed {{i|Broken Glass Cannon}} as a potential starting item for {{c|Eden}}.
* Removed {{i|Brother Bobby}} and {{i|Sister Maggy}} from the {{ip|Devil Room|text=Devil pool}} and added {{i|Dry Baby}} in their place.
* Holy shields from different sources now stack consistently and have a unique icon showing what the source of the next shield is. The priority is {{t|Wooden Cross}}, {{i|Blanket}}, {{i|Holy Mantle}}, {{p|Holy Card}}.
* Percs! [[Pills|Horse Pill]] now full heals Isaac in addition to adding {{i|The Wafer}} effect for the room.
* Addicted! Horse Pill now gives Isaac a broken heart.
* I'm Excited!!! Horse Pill now applies the effect for the duration of the floor.
* I'm Drowsy Horse Pill now applies the effect for the duration of the floor.
* ??? Horse Pill now add additional curses with each use.
* Telepills Horse Pill now guarantees a teleport to a special room.
* Gulp! Horse Pill now gulps the golden version of the held trinket.
* {{p|Hagalaz}} rune now destroys {{e|Stoney||Stonies}}, stone turrets and many stone-based enemies. It also breaks the armor of many others including {{e|Host}}s and {{e|Knight}}s.
* Healing with coins as {{c|Keeper}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper}} now contributes to {{i|Immaculate Conception}}.
* Using {{i|Potato Peeler}} while having {{i|Ball of Bandages}} will now contribute to Bandage Girl instead of giving Cubes of Meat.
* {{i|The Parasite}} now interacts with {{i|Tech X}}.
* {{e|Gold Heart}}s now explode into coins as soon as they are touched by {{c|The Lost}}/{{c|Tainted Lost}} and Keeper/Tainted Keeper.
* Items touched in the {{r|Ultra Secret Room}} with {{c|Tainted Cain}} will now guarantee one {{p|Cracked Key}} pickup.
* {{c|Tainted Bethany}} can now collect and store {{e|Rotten Heart}}s for use with active items.
* Added a new transformation, “{{tf|Necromancer}}”.
* Added a wave counter to {{r|Boss Rush}}.
* Added a slightly longer wind up before {{e|Camillo Jr.}} attacks.
* Online games will now dynamically adjust the cost of [[Devil Deal]]s for the player nearest to the item.
* Replaced Wednesday {{e|Delirium}} [[Daily Run]] end goal with random end goal and character.
* Added {{i|Clicker}} back into Daily Run pools.
* Removed score counter for non-daily runs.
* Permanently charmed enemies from {{i|Friendly Ball}} and Pheromones Horse Pill now award score when converted.
* If a player disconnects in the middle of a Daily Run, they will receive score up to the last completed floor instead of a zero score.
* Adjusted the chances for Daily Run end goals on Tuesday, Wednesday and Friday to be:
** 10% {{e|The Lamb}}
** 10% {{e|???}}
** 15% {{e|Isaac}}
** 15% {{e|Satan}}
** 10% {{e|Delirium}}
** 20% {{e|Mom's Heart}}
** 20% {{e|Mom}}

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed an issue where rerolling with {{c|Tainted Cain}} would result in all of his crafted items turning into Breakfast.
* Added {{t|Lazy Worm}} to the thematic payouts from worm bosses.
* Fixed an issue where {{e|Rotgut}} was unable to spawn his thematic drop.
* Fixed an issue where the flesh door would remain open during the alt path {{e|Mom's Heart}} fight.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} could duplicate {{i|Blood Puppy}}.
* Fixed an issue where Baptism by Fire and Bloody Mary challenges were starting with {{i|Book of Virtues}}.
* Fixed an issue where {{e|Fissure}} enemies could despawn on uncleared rooms.
* Fixed an issue where {{t|Filigree Feather}} would prioritize Key Piece drops. A Key Piece will only drop if the player already has the other piece, collected without Filigree Feather.
* Fixed an issue where using {{i|Book of Virtues}} between active item pickups would give infinite free wisps.
* Fixed a crash that could occur when using {{i|Genesis}} after using {{i|Death Certificate}}.
* Fixed an issue where using {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} in Downpour 1 would teleport the player to {{s|Home}}.
* Fixed an issue where Glowing Hourglass could cause {{c|Tainted Lilith}} to be unable to shoot.
* Fixed an issue where items granted to {{c|Esau}} when using {{p|Soul of Jacob and Esau}} were removed from future item pools.
* Fixed an issue where {{r|Boss Rush}} could prematurely close on Home daily runs.
* Fixed an issue with charged items not firing with {{i|Epiphora}}.
* Fixed an issue where spectral tears would cause {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}} to bounce off of walls.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Star of Bethlehem}} would significantly speed up its pathing while the player is in an off-grid room.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Belly Jelly}} and {{i|Cone Head}} could prevent the on-damage effects of items from triggering when using {{i|Dull Razor}}.
* Fixed an issue where {{e|Black Maw}} was not charging to the right correctly.
* Fixed an issue where a ??? pill could prevent the chest from appearing after defeating Satan in Ultra Hard.
* Fixed an issue where killing {{e|Greed}} could remove {{i|Coupon}} and {{i|Head of the Keeper}} from future pools.
* Fixed a bomb exploit that allowed the first phase of {{e|Dogma}} to be skipped.
* Added a time delay between the sound effects for {{i|Little Chubby}}, {{i|Big Chubby}}, and {{i|Lil Haunt}}.
* Fixed an issue where consumable pop-ups were miniaturized when holding {{t|Found Soul}}.
* Fixed an issue where game sounds would not correctly switch when the output device changed.
* {{i|Suplex!}} no longer works on fireplaces or during {{i|Mega Mush}}, preventing softlocks and unintended damage.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Camo Undies}} would not come out of stealth when using mouse controls.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Eye of the Occult}} tears would not travel to the cursor when using mouse controls.
* Fixed an issue where flies from {{tf|Beelzebub}} could be farmed for infinite daily run points.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Keeper}} would lose his {{i|Birthright}} effect after the Mom Chase.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Tainted Jacob}} could not be damaged by copies of Dark Esau from {{i|Birthright}}.
* Fixed an issue where {{e|Camillo Jr.}} could fire from offscreen in [[Greed Mode]].
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Wavy Cap}} tears up could be kept and distortion effects could be removed by exiting and continuing the run.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Bumbo}}'s evolution would be reset after the Mom Chase.
* Fixed an issue where ice shards from frozen enemies could freeze and damage friendly monsters.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Abyss}} Locusts were not removed during the Mom Chase, causing potential softlocks.
* Fixed an issue where crawl spaces could spawn during the Mother Chase, causing potential softlocks.
* Fixed an issue where a dead zone in the center of {{e|Red Poop}}s was not triggering damage.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Consolation Prize}} would always drop a bomb when playing as {{c|Tainted ???}}.
* Fixed an issue where losing an {{e|Eternal Heart}} while the player has {{e|Rotten Heart}}s resulted in taking an extra half heart of damage.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Dream Catcher}} could display incorrect {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the Alt Path when combined with some other items.
* Fixed an issue where copies of {{e|Dark Esau}} beyond the first were not doing damage to Tainted Jacob.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Tainted Bethany}} would not start with the correct number of stored red hearts in co-op if she was not player one.
* Fixed an issue that allowed Keeper and {{c|Tainted Keeper}} to gain infinite health with {{t|Mother's Kiss}} trinkets.
* Fixed an issue where exiting and continuing would remove the I'm Excited effect.
* Fixed an issue where using {{p|Soul of Cain}} in the mirror room would break the mirror.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Bethany}}'s starting {{i|Book of Virtues}} was not contributing to the {{tf|Bookworm}} transformation.
* Fixed an issue where a crawl space would not spawn if placed under certain rocks.
* Fixed an issue where {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} would not refund a teleport card if used to undo that teleport.
* Fixed an issue where tech items would not break open secret rooms with {{i|Terra}} or {{i|Sulfuric Acid}}.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Tainted Lazarus}} could respawn as another character on death and lose story items if they were held by the other Lazarus half.
* Fixed an issue where collecting a {{e|Bone Heart}} could remove charges from {{i|Alabaster Box}}.
* Fixed an issue where {{e|Bloaty}}'s creep attack could hit flying characters.
* Fixed an issue where playing a {{m|Blood Donation Machine}} with the {{t|Swallowed M80}} trinket would not cause the machine to be destroyed when Isaac explodes.
* Fixed an issue where using {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} immediately after taking {{i|Dad's Note}} resulted in a softlock.

